{"answer":"\n{\n  \"to\": \"user\",\n  \"text\": {\n    \"template_matching\": \"agent_answer\",\n    \"cypher\": [\n      \"MATCH (g:gene) WHERE g.name = \\\"CFTR\\\" WITH collect(DISTINCT g) AS nodes, [] AS edges RETURN nodes, edges;\",\n      \"MATCH (g:gene)-[r:effector_gene_of]->(d:disease) WHERE d.name = \\\"type 1 diabetes\\\" WITH collect(DISTINCT g) AS nodes, collect(DISTINCT r) AS edges RETURN nodes, edges;\"\n    ],\n    \"summary\": \"Answer\\nThe CFTR gene (cystic fibrosis transmembrane conductance regulator) contributes to Type 1 Diabetes (T1D) primarily through its role in the exocrine pancreas. Research has identified a T1D-associated risk variant (rs7795896) located in a ductal-specific cis-regulatory element (cCRE), which reduces transcription factor binding, enhancer activity, and CFTR expression in pancreatic ductal cells. This suggests that CFTR dysfunction may influence T1D development by altering exocrine pancreatic function, leading to inflammatory and structural changes in pancreatic tissue [PubMed ID: 34012112]. Additionally, while CFTR expression in pancreatic islets is minimal, its dysfunction is indirectly linked to broader pancreatic remodeling and immune infiltration [PubMed ID: 29669939].\\n\\nGene overview\\nThe CFTR gene is located on chromosome 7 and encodes a protein critical for ion transport across epithelial membranes. This function is essential for maintaining fluid balance in tissues such as the pancreas. Although primarily known for its role in cystic fibrosis, CFTR dysfunction can indirectly affect pancreatic function, potentially influencing both exocrine and endocrine processes.\\n\\nSpecific relation to Type 1 Diabetes\\nCFTR's role in T1D is not direct but is mediated through its regulation in the exocrine pancreas. Disruption of CFTR expression, as seen with the T1D-associated variant rs7795896, can lead to changes in the pancreatic microenvironment, contributing to immune infiltration and tissue remodeling. These processes may indirectly impact the development of T1D.\"\n  }\n}","processing_time_ms":27898.783206939697}



